  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing the landscape of reading in Puerto Rico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our goal at Lectores para el futuro is to build capacity providing professional development for educators teaching in grades K to 3rd in order for them to gain research-based strategies to teach how to read. Also, gaining skills to identify those who may have dyslexia or other reading difficulties. Our aim this academic year is to provide training to the 7 districs of the Department of Education in Puerto Rico. This way, we can continue building readers for the future.</narrative>
  </description>
